cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HCSM — Human Cognitive State Model"
message: If you use this framework, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "HCSM contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/Sathancabrol/HCSM"
abstract: >-
  Scientific framework for representing human cognitive state at T0 as a
  latent, multidimensional, contextualized, temporal and evidential object,
  with explicit provenance and uncertainty. Cognition Hub is the computational
  system; HCSM is the underlying scientific model.
keywords:
  - cognitive state
  - ontology
  - evidence graph
  - inference
  - uncertainty
  - provenance
  - digital phenotyping
  - RDoC
  - ICF
  - Cognitive Atlas
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 0.1.1
date-released: "2026-08-25"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sathancabrol/HCSM"
url: "https://github.com/Sathancabrol/HCSM"
